There used to be a workaround (=hack) for that. Make the destination a
DECnet task specification   node::"0=backup"

That will invoke backup.com when the connection is made. In that file
put the commands to mount the tape and copy sys$net: to it.

This is old (VMS4.n) and was possible between two VMS systems, I've no idea
if it will work for you but may be worth a try. You'll probably have to
play with the tape block sizes.

Steve


