connected to a VAX or  a PDP-11 that can output to some kind of output medium
we can use, and that you'd be willing to let us use for this purpose?  (We can
read RL01s,  RL02s, RA60, reel-to-reel tape at 1600 or 6250 bpi, 8mm tape at
either high or low density, PC or Mac format diskettes, RX33s or RX50s, and a
few other options.)

The users are in fairly urgent need, of course, so I would appreciate a
quick response by phone or e-mail.

Thanks in advance,

-- Alan


