Well, I actually publish such a newsletter.  I'm afraid I'd have to agree
that making money seems a long way down the road.  So far its been
pretty much an expensive hobby.  We do tend to cover free software
pretty often - for example, this issue has an article on linux (and in
the next issue we're giving away a copy of it with the newsletter).

I do this mostly because it is what I want to do , and because I have
the luxury of a real job that keeps me fed and housed.  

