money, at least from my current experience.  But ask me again in a few
more issues.

There ARE a lot of non-advertiser-supported publications out there
in the UNIX field.  I think we each sort of have a niche.  Our readers
are still sort of determining what ours will be.  I AM real interested
in marketplaces that people think aren't being fulfilled, by the way,
since we are trying to fill some of those holes ourselves.
