X      Sets the backup date on the file(s) equal to the specified time.
X      If no value is given, the default is to use the current date and
X      time.  If /NOBACKUP_DATE is specified, the backup date is set to
X      the VMS base date of 17-NOV-1858 00:00:00.00.
X
X /BEFORE
X  `032
X         /BEFORE`091=time`093
X
X      Selects only those files dated prior to the specified time.  The
X      default date to compare this time against in selecting files is`032
X      the revision date, but this can be changed with the /MODIFIER`032
X      qualifier.  If no time is specified, the default value is TODAY.
X
