X      modifying the file.  The default is not to do so.  This qualifier
X      functions somewhat differently than the confirm qualifier in other
X      VMS utilities (such as DELETE and RENAME).  Valid affirmative
X      responses are YES, TRUE, and 1, however, only the first letter is
X      significant.  Any response beginning with Y, for example, will be
X      considered as YES.  Pressing the control-z key or typing QUIT (again,
X      only the first letter is significant) aborts the command.  Entering
