thrashing for lack of memory.  Then there was the 11/24 - 22 bit address 
space, but slowww.

Buses (sp?) varied around a bit too.  They were all based on the Unibus or 
Q-bus, but some of the Unibus machines had extra buses.  The 11/45 had Fastbus 
(I think, the 11/70 had Massbus, and the 11/60 had 1 1/2 Unibuses !!! (Two 
