I was glad to see Gail Grant's message here about DEC participation in
newsgroups.  Gail has been instrumental in changing some of the
attitudes regarding newsgroup participation inside DEC, and I think you'll
see more participation in the future.  I believe only good things will come 
of this.

You'll see me from time to time in comp.os.vms and comp.lang.fortran; I've
got almost 14 years of VMS development experience, and I know there are other 
similarly experienced developers who respond here.  

By the way, if any of you will be attending the spring DECUS symposium
in Atlanta, come look me up and say hello - you can find me through the
Languages and Tools SIG campground.

