> A friend (who supposedly read it in the trades) says that the initial
> release of VMS on the alpha will be a 32-bit mode.  IMHO, anyone who
> buys today's Alpha chip thinking it'll run 64-bit tomorrow is taking
> the same risk that we all took thinking the 80286 would really run
> in two useful modes.  It might happen, but until you see running systems
